crypto-ops-data.c, crypto-ops.h, keccak.c, keccak.h) and a C port of
traaitt/src/crypto/crypto.cpp (xte_crypto.c). Their original notices are kept
in each file; the traaitt license is in Sources/CXTECrypto/LICENSE-traaitt-GPL3.txt.
GPL-3.0 code may be combined with AGPL-3.0 code (GPLv3 section 13).

Sources/XTEWalletCore/MnemonicWordList.swift is the English CryptoNote
mnemonic word list from traaitt/src/mnemonics/WordList.h.

Tests/XTEWalletCoreTests/Vectors/crypto-tests.txt is a subset of
tests/crypto/tests.txt from the Monero Project (BSD-3-Clause).

The app icon is the XTE/traaitt icon from TRRXITTE/XTEcash-wallet.
